---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageMasthead from "../components/PageMasthead.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Racquet Habit"
  description="Read how Racquet Habit collects, uses, stores and shares personal information when you browse the site or place an order."
>
  <PageMasthead
    title="Privacy policy"
    intro="This notice explains the limited information used by racquethabit.com and how Fourthwall handles information when you place or manage an order."
    issue="Site policy · Effective 23 July 2026"
  />

  <article class="policy-page">
    <aside><span>Plain-language notice</span><span>Last updated 23 July 2026</span><span>Applies to racquethabit.com</span></aside>
    <div>
      <section><h2>1. Who this notice covers</h2><p>This policy covers the Racquet Habit website at racquethabit.com. Current product checkout, payment, fulfillment and order support are provided by Fourthwall under its own privacy terms. When you leave this site for Fourthwall, its notice applies to the information you provide there.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Information this site uses</h2><p>The site stores your display-currency preference and shopping bag in your browser’s local storage. That information stays on your device until you clear it. The hosting provider may process routine request information such as IP address, browser details, requested pages, timestamps and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Checkout and orders</h2><p>When you proceed to checkout, the product variant IDs and quantities in your bag are passed to Fourthwall. Racquet Habit does not collect payment-card details on this site. Fourthwall processes order, contact, delivery, payment, tax and support information as merchant and fulfillment partner.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This version of the site does not install advertising cookies or a separate analytics service. Fourthwall may use cookies and similar technology on its storefront and checkout. Review its notice before submitting an order if you need more detail.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Sharing and retention</h2><p>Browser-local bag and currency data are not transmitted to Racquet Habit until you choose checkout, when the selected products are included in the Fourthwall checkout link. Hosting security logs may be retained by the hosting provider under its operational policies. Order information is retained by Fourthwall according to its legal and service requirements.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. Your choices</h2><p>You can remove local bag and currency data by clearing site data in your browser. For access, correction or deletion requests concerning an order, use Fourthwall order support. For questions about this site, contact Racquet Habit using the address on the contact page.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>Material changes will be posted here with a revised date. If new analytics, email signup or advertising tools are added, this notice will be updated before those tools are enabled.</p></section>
      <a class="paper-button" href="/contact">Privacy question <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
